check 1
# `operate` (specs/tools/poke.md §1, §4 rule 10, §5 rule 4): the Rogue
# Encampment waypoint (objects 119, at (4899, 4209) in this town), ScnAma,
# -seed 1234, no input. The player is poked next to it (each point inside a
# room already active), then before frame 10 one `operate @2:119`: the
# server's dispatcher run at once with 0x13 {2, waypoint GUID} on both
# sides (world/waypoints.md §5.2: the waypoint bit, the menu). Frames
# 10-30 compare the state and the S->C replies.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name interact-operate-waypoint
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 300
channels state packets
at 4 poke pos @player 4888 4220
at 7 poke pos @player 4896 4213
at 10 poke operate @2:119
